-/**
- * A connection between two operators. Represents an intermediate result and a data exchange between
- * the two operators.
- *
- * <p>The data exchange has a mode in which it performs (batch / pipelined).
- *
- * <p>The data exchange strategy may be set on this connection, in which case it is fixed and will
- * not be determined during candidate plan enumeration.
